《深夜翻译官》 The Night Translator (v2) — third-party assets in this film

Fonts (SIL Open Font License 1.1; licence texts in fonts/), via npm @fontsource:
- Noto Serif SC (Google / Adobe) — cards and pages; only the unicode-range chunks used
- Ma Shan Zheng (Ma Shan Zheng) — the red brush corrections
- Playfair Display SC (Claus Eggers Sørensen), Old Standard TT (Alexey Kryukov) — studio cards, page headings
- Rye (Nicole Fally), Pinyon Script (Nicole Fally), UnifrakturMaguntia (j. 'mach' wust) — the three genre reel cards

Sampled instruments (played by core/audio/sampler.py):
- VS Chamber Orchestra: Community Edition (Versilian Studios), CC0 1.0 — upright piano, violins, cellos, contrabass,
  clarinet, bassoon, flute, trumpet (open and muted), timpani, glockenspiel, xylophone, tubular bells
- Versilian Community Sample Library (VCSL, Versilian Studios), CC0 1.0 — woodblock, triangle, clash cymbals, snare,
  bass drum, shaker

Everything else — drawings, robots, sets, the films-within-the-film, the ink and film-print passes (adapted from the
library's silent-film engine), the score, the synthesised trap effects and the projector — was made in code for this
film. No voice, no footage, no stock images or recordings.
